<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>CONTENTS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><I>Results of Annual General Meeting</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><I>&nbsp;</I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On September 8, 2026, the Company held its 2026
Annual General Meeting of Shareholders (the &ldquo;Meeting&rdquo;), at the Company&rsquo;s offices located at 30 Hacharoshet Street, Or
Yehuda, Israel. The proposals on the Meeting&rsquo;s agenda are described in the Company&rsquo;s Proxy Statement for the 2026 AGM, which
was attached as Exhibit 99.1 to a Report of Foreign Private Issuer on Form 6-K, furnished to the Securities and Exchange Commission, dated
August 4, 2026. Proposals 4 through 7 (reverse share split authorization, share capital increase, private placement exercises and auditor
reappointment) were approved by the requisite majority of the Company&rsquo;s shareholders, while Proposals 1 through 3 (redesignation
of the class of a director, compensation policy extension and board committee compensation) were not approved.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

